{
  "description": "std-agent-context — keeps what an in-app assistant sends the model bounded. COMPACT { messages } passes a conversation of at most `keepMessages` turns straight through as COMPACTED; a longer one has its older turns summarized with `call-service llm summarize` into one leading note and keeps the last `keepMessages` turns verbatim. If summarizing fails, the older turns are dropped and the recent ones still go through, with a visible warning — a summarizer outage never blocks the assistant. Headless. Nothing is persisted: the conversation itself lives in std-agent-session.",
  "ledger": {
    "entries": {
      "ent_01M3TYMQJMGY8DD73YX22WEW07": {
        "bakedName": "AgentContextWindow",
        "curName": "AgentContextWindow",
